as part of paid consulting, research, or advisory work; using it to
produce reports, newsletters, or data feeds that are sold or used to
promote a business; and using it for the business operations of any
company, partnership, or other for-profit entity.

"Personal Use" means use by a single individual, for their own private,
non-commercial purposes, on their own devices, without providing the
Software or the Data to any third party.

